0..54 Comment "// What is not open stays at the world it was made at."
55..57 Comment "//"
58..134 Comment "// A handle crosses as the content of the value it holds. A thunk crosses by"
135..207 Comment "// what it captures. A thunk over a value that is not mobile is not open"
208..254 Comment "// under a handle, and not mobile without one."
255..257 Comment "//"
258..334 Comment "// Each declaration migrates to the seat and returns a thunk over the seat\'s"
335..406 Comment "// unmarked dispatch. The refusal names the judgement that fails at the"
407..485 Comment "// capture: `NotOpen.Capture` under a handle, `Immobile.Capture` met directly."
486..488 Comment "//"
489..565 Comment "// - see: Rainey et al., \"LoCalMem\", PACMPL 10 (ICFP 2026), § 5.1, openness"
566..626 Comment "// - see: `model/worlds/open.gandr` — what is open crosses"
628..702 Comment "// The operator\'s and the seat\'s worlds, each declaration\'s entry, and the"
703..764 Comment "// seat\'s sealed side of the exchange, its dispatch unmarked."
